    <Element Type="Comment" Id="D6759169">
        <Comment>
            Dear Friend,
            -
            I have left my map open for you to edit and learn from.
            &gt; You are welcome to take from it what you like.
            &gt; If you make any new variations based upon
               the original, that you please credit me somewhere.
            &gt; You don't need to ask permission to make new
               variations
            &gt; If you are making minor balance or gameplay changes,
               it's probably better if you contact me directly to put it into
               the main version.
            &gt; You can contact me through email or gtalk at 
               mikelat@gmail.com
            -
                   Sincerely, mikelat (US, character code 610)
            -
            PS. If you're here to steal the map, its really not worth it.
        </Comment>
    </Element>
